flowchart TD
  U[Attendee / Base User] --> P1[Browse Conferences]
  P1 --> P2[Open Conference Details]

  P2 -->|If Registration Open| R1[Register]
  R1 --> R2[Answer Custom Questions - optional]
  R2 --> R3[Registration Confirmed]

  P2 -->|If Program Published| S1[View Program]
  S1 --> S2[Timeline View]
  S1 --> S3[Tree View]
  S2 --> D1[Open Presentation Details]
  S3 --> D1

  D1 --> F1[Toggle Favourite]
  F1 --> F2[View Favourites List]

  P2 --> SR1[Search Presentations]
  SR1 --> D1
